{"3037040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Board Game Society", "steam_appid": 3037040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4847050], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board game night, without the fuss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheaper than a physical boardgame  but  easier, and filled with interactive surprises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice rolls, loot, PvP and sudden board events keep everyone on their toes, whether a giant spider storms across the board or a UFO swaps two players’ positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rulebooks, no cleanup — just jump in with friends anytime, anywhere, and scratch that board game itch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>With Friends Pass, only one player needs to own the game. Invite your friends and play together without everyone having to buy a copy.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/77be6a3212bc8a6adcc6b1c4141ca3e5.poster.avif?t=1788265668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/77be6a3212bc8a6adcc6b1c4141ca3e5.webm?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/77be6a3212bc8a6adcc6b1c4141ca3e5.mp4?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/608730e04d4f437f47b874ba7b9addf6.webp?t=1788265668\" width=614 height=60 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/a63a3b6333c552f3577c6206503af99d.poster.avif?t=1788265668\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/a63a3b6333c552f3577c6206503af99d.webm?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/a63a3b6333c552f3577c6206503af99d.mp4?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                               Battle your way through the board. The tougher the foe, the better the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/a576fdff8f983239f44df6f032556942.webp?t=1788265668\" width=614 height=60 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                    Trick, trap, or take them down... but beware, they’ll do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>                     </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/57fa208674e8c60021040c2082cb9905.webp?t=1788265668\" width=614 height=60 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/50e270603309a610969df6a4eabd7bee.poster.avif?t=1788265668\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/50e270603309a610969df6a4eabd7bee.webm?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/50e270603309a610969df6a4eabd7bee.mp4?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                  Hunt down hidden crystals across the board. No crystals, no final fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/83ef4261e50a8b822b1afc37e654b36d.webp?t=1788265668\" width=614 height=60 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one can claim victory. Will you have the most crystals? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer PVP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer PVE </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Boardgame aesthetics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Horror satirical elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Custom cards and boardgame </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skin customization </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tabletop vibes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > P2P hosting solution </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple Events </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board game night, without the fuss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheaper than a physical boardgame  but  easier, and filled with interactive surprises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice rolls, loot, PvP and sudden board events keep everyone on their toes, whether a giant spider storms across the board or a UFO swaps two players’ positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rulebooks, no cleanup — just jump in with friends anytime, anywhere, and scratch that board game itch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>With Friends Pass, only one player needs to own the game. Invite your friends and play together without everyone having to buy a copy.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/77be6a3212bc8a6adcc6b1c4141ca3e5.poster.avif?t=1788265668\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/77be6a3212bc8a6adcc6b1c4141ca3e5.webm?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/77be6a3212bc8a6adcc6b1c4141ca3e5.mp4?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/608730e04d4f437f47b874ba7b9addf6.webp?t=1788265668\" width=614 height=60 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/a63a3b6333c552f3577c6206503af99d.poster.avif?t=1788265668\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/a63a3b6333c552f3577c6206503af99d.webm?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/a63a3b6333c552f3577c6206503af99d.mp4?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                               Battle your way through the board. The tougher the foe, the better the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/a576fdff8f983239f44df6f032556942.webp?t=1788265668\" width=614 height=60 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                    Trick, trap, or take them down... but beware, they’ll do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>                     </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/57fa208674e8c60021040c2082cb9905.webp?t=1788265668\" width=614 height=60 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/50e270603309a610969df6a4eabd7bee.poster.avif?t=1788265668\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/50e270603309a610969df6a4eabd7bee.webm?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/50e270603309a610969df6a4eabd7bee.mp4?t=1788265668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                  Hunt down hidden crystals across the board. No crystals, no final fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/83ef4261e50a8b822b1afc37e654b36d.webp?t=1788265668\" width=614 height=60 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one can claim victory. Will you have the most crystals? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer PVP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer PVE </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Boardgame aesthetics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Horror satirical elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Custom cards and boardgame </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skin customization </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tabletop vibes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > P2P hosting solution </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple Events </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Board Game Society is a casual digital board game soaked in 80s VHS horror vibes. Play as a misfit crew of teen archetypes such as the goth, the jock, the nerd, and more as you explore the cursed forest of Timber Falls. Roll the dice to fight monsters, collect loot, and race to defeat the Boss.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/55f4aee7acd124c8fe763b9578110cd793001212/header.jpg?t=1788265668", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/6d1f9d279eb9cd3235effaf5f530ed48ffd6ba23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788265668", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/6d1f9d279eb9cd3235effaf5f530ed48ffd6ba23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788265668", "website": "https://jetebra.se", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> W